{"4176280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lofton Oasis", "steam_appid": 4176280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help your boss scrub down the hotel bathrooms!</strong><br><i>Discover all sorts of playful, quirky interactions!</i><br><i>Prove your cleaning skills within 7 days and earn everyone’s respect…</i><br><i>…or let your inner menace out and wow them with pure chaos instead.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>“Lofton Oasis” is a cartoon-style cleaning game full of messy, doodle-like physics and playful interactions.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you will play as a motel janitor who needs to achieve certain amount of reputations in 7 days by doing a good job of cleaning the bathroom.  You could use varies tools to bring tidiness back to the motel bathroom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the time progressing and days passing in the game, the bathroom will be messier and messier each time and  upgradations of janitor tools are needed!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In bathroom:<strong><i> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WASD  </i></strong>to move camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Left Click (or hold)</i></strong>  to interact with objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects have more interactions when you dragging/ interacting, to trigger that, simply <strong><i>RIGHT CLICK !</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BE CAREFUL !! DONT MOVE YOUR MOUSE TOO FAST &gt;.&lt;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play Time:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>45 - 60 mins</i></u></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help your boss scrub down the hotel bathrooms!</strong><br><i>Discover all sorts of playful, quirky interactions!</i><br><i>Prove your cleaning skills within 7 days and earn everyone’s respect…</i><br><i>…or let your inner menace out and wow them with pure chaos instead.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>“Lofton Oasis” is a cartoon-style cleaning game full of messy, doodle-like physics and playful interactions.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you will play as a motel janitor who needs to achieve certain amount of reputations in 7 days by doing a good job of cleaning the bathroom.  You could use varies tools to bring tidiness back to the motel bathroom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the time progressing and days passing in the game, the bathroom will be messier and messier each time and  upgradations of janitor tools are needed!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In bathroom:<strong><i> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WASD  </i></strong>to move camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Left Click (or hold)</i></strong>  to interact with objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects have more interactions when you dragging/ interacting, to trigger that, simply <strong><i>RIGHT CLICK !</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BE CAREFUL !! DONT MOVE YOUR MOUSE TOO FAST &gt;.&lt;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play Time:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>45 - 60 mins</i></u></p>", "short_description": "In Lofton Oasis, you can either enjoy laughter-filled toilet cleaning… or just lose your mind and cause chaos on the spot.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176280/4f2b1656cb013d94f2b4a21544a7a72f3ecfb0cd/header.jpg?t=1770180208", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176280/9bc2950a9d50e222e2b169b1b1c80252c70b2158/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770180208", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st